    "expression_latex": "\\lim_{T\\ra \\infty} \\frac {\\cR(\\phi^{TS,\\pi_J},T)}{\\ln T} = \\sum_{a = 1}^K \\frac{\\mu(\\theta_{a^*})-\\mu(\\theta_a)}{\\K(\\theta_a, \\theta_{a^*})}",
