    "expression_latex": "\\frac{1+\\epsilon}{1-\\epsilon}\\left(\\sum_{a=2}^{K}\\frac{(\\mu_1-\\mu_a)}{\\K(\\theta_a,\\theta_1)}\\right)\\ln(T) + \\mathcal{C}(\\epsilon,\\mathcal{P})",
